.TH NFC-DETECT 1 "2026-06-27" "libnci 1.0.0-alpha.1" "libnci manual"
.SH NAME
nfc-detect \- poll for any NFC tag and print its UID
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B nfc-detect
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B nfc-detect
brings up an NCI controller and polls across NFC-A/B/F/V, printing the UID of
each tag it sees. It is the smallest end-to-end check that the controller and
wiring are working.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI --chip " PATH"
GPIO chip device node; autodetected when omitted.
.TP
.BI --bus " PATH"
I2C bus device node (default: /dev/i2c-1).
.TP
.BI --dwl " N"
GPIO line offset for the firmware-download (DWL) pin.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B NCI_LOG
Log verbosity 0\(en5.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 on a clean exit, non-zero if the device could not be opened.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR nfc-poll (1),
.BR nfc-read-ndef (1)
.SH AUTHOR
Part of the libnci NFC stack.
